; claude: BASIC, the Tiny BASIC of 1976 (plan_terminal.md, section 5):
; Basic_parse (a line read, by recursive descent), Basic_run (a
; program run, as a Teletype conversation: INPUT a read whose
; continuation is the rest of the program), Basic_session (the prompt,
; editor and calculator in one, as in 1977). Run by TinyBasic
; (apps/devtools/) and by TinyTerminal's shell as its command basic.
;
; Over the playground's Teletype way; a private library, installed as
; part of elm_playground, pure OCaml, so every backend can run it.
(library
 (name appkit_basic)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries elm_playground)
)
